## Networking & authority

- Model: {{NETWORKING_MODEL}}{{AUTHORITY_CLAUSE}}. Player ceiling: {{PLAYER_CEILING}}.
- Session discovery: {{DISCOVERY_LIST}}.
- Drop-in/drop-out (late-join) is a requirement, not a stretch goal. It runs
  through the same serialize-authoritative-state → transfer → hydrate
  pipeline as save/load; a late joiner is save/load with a network in
  between. Don't build a second hydration path for it.
- {{DETERMINISM_LINE}}
<!--
  DETERMINISM_LINE default (Determinism=No, or Authority != Deterministic
  lockstep): "Host-authoritative state and float math are the baseline.
  Don't introduce fixed-point or lockstep."
  DETERMINISM_LINE override (Determinism=Yes AND Networking=Online
  multiplayer AND Authority=Deterministic lockstep): "Deterministic
  lockstep: simulation math is fixed-point, not float; every sim input is
  an ordered command; replay hashes are the correctness check."
-->

