## Localization

{{LOCALIZATION_ANSWER}}. No user-facing string is a literal in code or a
fixed-width label in a scene — text routes through `TranslationServer` and
lays out in containers that flex. Assume translated text runs 30%+ longer
than the source language, and that some locales are right-to-left.

